<section class="page-head compact"><span class="eyebrow">내 계정</span><h1>회원 정보와 주문 내역</h1><p>회원가입 후 구매대행 신청과 주문 내역 조회를 이용할 수 있습니다.</p></section>
<section class="account-grid"><form id="register-form" class="panel-form"><h2>회원가입</h2><label>이름<input name="name" required minlength="2"></label><label>이메일<input name="email" type="email" required></label><label>비밀번호<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="10" autocomplete="new-password"></label><button class="primary" type="submit">회원가입 <span>→</span></button><div class="form-message"></div></form><form id="login-form" class="panel-form"><h2>로그인</h2><label>이메일<input name="email" type="email" required></label><label>비밀번호<input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button class="primary" type="submit">로그인 <span>→</span></button><div class="form-message"></div></form><div id="account-summary" class="panel-form" hidden><h2>로그인 정보</h2><p id="account-name"></p><button id="logout-button" class="secondary">로그아웃</button><h3>내 주문</h3><div id="my-orders"></div></div></section>
